#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_2F/scripts.inc:12
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_2F_Text_ShipDesignMoreLikeBuilding"
msgid ""
"Designing a large ship is more like\n"
"making a big building than putting\l"
"together a transportation vehicle.$"
msgstr ""
"设计大型船只，与其说是组装交通工具，\n"
"更像是在建造一栋大楼。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_2F/scripts.inc:17
msgctxt "SlateportCity_SternsShipyard_2F_Text_FloatsBecauseBuoyancy"
msgid ""
"Don't you think it's strange that\n"
"a ship made of heavy iron floats?\p"
"It floats because of a principle\n"
"called buoyancy.$"
msgstr ""
"用沉重的钢铁造的船居然能浮起来，\n"
"你不觉得很奇怪吗？\p"
"它能浮起来，\n"
"是因为一种叫做浮力的原理。$"
